{'symbol': 'CTRA', 'date': '2021-10-04 07:00:00', 'title': 'COTERRA ANNOUNCES SPECIAL DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON, OCT. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0COTERRA ENERGY INC. ("COTERRA" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: CTRA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A SPECIAL CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.50 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 22, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON OCTOBER 14, 2021. THOMAS E.'}